{"id":"c5415e6aa9a22f33","group":"27","path":"27/27-thm-bestfitexact.md","title":"Zero best fit is exact extension under positive weights","display":"thm-bestfitexact — Zero best fit is exact extension under positive weights","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications","book_abbrev":"27","label":"27-thm-bestfitexact","aliases":["27-thm-bestfitexact"],"display":"thm-bestfitexact — Zero best fit is exact extension under positive weights","depends_on":["[[27-df-bestfit]]","[[27-df-extension]]","[[27-df-fiterror]]"],"source_file":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf","source_section":"§12.4, BEST-FIT(C) versus EXTENSION(C)","source_printed_pages":"548","source_pdf_pages":"572","verification_status":"source-observation-checked-and-proved-in-note"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"27"},{"key":"label","html":"27-thm-bestfitexact"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>27-thm-bestfitexact</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-bestfitexact — Zero best fit is exact extension under positive weights"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"715fc2a2ad4968cc\" href=\"?note=715fc2a2ad4968cc\" title=\"27-df-bestfit\">27-df-bestfit</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"2080bf803b294b75\" href=\"?note=2080bf803b294b75\" title=\"27-df-extension\">27-df-extension</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"00d5aa0e1574d0b4\" href=\"?note=00d5aa0e1574d0b4\" title=\"27-df-fiterror\">27-df-fiterror</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_file","html":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf"},{"key":"source_section","html":"§12.4, BEST-FIT(C) versus EXTENSION(C)"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"548"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"572"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-observation-checked-and-proved-in-note"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T,F\\subseteq\\mathbb B^n\">\\(T,F\\subseteq\\mathbb B^n\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"w:T\\cup F\\to\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\">\\(w:T\\cup F\\to\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\emptyset\\ne\\mathcal K\\subseteq\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n\">\\(\\emptyset\\ne\\mathcal K\\subseteq\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n\\)</span>；最优函数族见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"715fc2a2ad4968cc\" href=\"?note=715fc2a2ad4968cc\" title=\"27-df-bestfit\">27-df-bestfit</a>，扩张族见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"2080bf803b294b75\" href=\"?note=2080bf803b294b75\" title=\"27-df-extension\">27-df-extension</a>。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BestFit}_n,\\mathrm{Err}_n\">\\(\\mathrm{BestFit}_n,\\mathrm{Err}_n\\)</span> 使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"715fc2a2ad4968cc\" href=\"?note=715fc2a2ad4968cc\" title=\"27-df-bestfit\">27-df-bestfit</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"00d5aa0e1574d0b4\" href=\"?note=00d5aa0e1574d0b4\" title=\"27-df-fiterror\">27-df-fiterror</a> 的精确接口，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ext}_n\">\\(\\mathrm{Ext}_n\\)</span> 使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"2080bf803b294b75\" href=\"?note=2080bf803b294b75\" title=\"27-df-extension\">27-df-extension</a> 的固定元数接口。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\min_{f\\in\\mathcal K}\\mathrm{Err}_n(f;T,F,w)=0\\quad\\Longleftrightarrow\\quad\\mathcal K\\cap\\mathrm{Ext}_n(T,F)\\ne\\emptyset.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\min_{f\\in\\mathcal K}\\mathrm{Err}_n(f;T,F,w)=0\\quad\\Longleftrightarrow\\quad\\mathcal K\\cap\\mathrm{Ext}_n(T,F)\\ne\\emptyset.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal K\\cap\\mathrm{Ext}_n(T,F)\\ne\\emptyset\\quad\\Longrightarrow\\quad\\mathrm{BestFit}_n(T,F,w;\\mathcal K)=\\mathcal K\\cap\\mathrm{Ext}_n(T,F).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal K\\cap\\mathrm{Ext}_n(T,F)\\ne\\emptyset\\quad\\Longrightarrow\\quad\\mathrm{BestFit}_n(T,F,w;\\mathcal K)=\\mathcal K\\cap\\mathrm{Ext}_n(T,F).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>来源：§12.4 的 BEST-FIT 含 EXTENSION 这一特例观察，印刷页 548 / PDF 第 572 页。这里显式固定严格正权，否则零误差不保证每个样本正确。证明：非负有限和为零，且各样本权重严格正，等价于没有任何误分类；这恰是扩张条件。非空 K 是有限函数载体的子集，最小值存在。原书观察已核对；一般等价和最优者集合的本地证明如上，不使用 NP-hardness 的外部证明。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"27-df-bestfit","status":"resolved","id":"715fc2a2ad4968cc","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-bestfit]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-extension","status":"resolved","id":"2080bf803b294b75","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-extension]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-fiterror","status":"resolved","id":"00d5aa0e1574d0b4","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-fiterror]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-bestfit","status":"resolved","id":"715fc2a2ad4968cc","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$，$T,F\\subseteq\\mathbb B^n$，$w:T\\cup F\\to\\mathbb R_{>0}$，$\\emptyset\\ne\\mathcal K\\subseteq\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n$；最优函数族见 [[27-df-bestfit]]，扩张族见 [[27-df-extension]]。","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-extension","status":"resolved","id":"2080bf803b294b75","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$，$T,F\\subseteq\\mathbb B^n$，$w:T\\cup F\\to\\mathbb R_{>0}$，$\\emptyset\\ne\\mathcal K\\subseteq\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n$；最优函数族见 [[27-df-bestfit]]，扩张族见 [[27-df-extension]]。","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-bestfit","status":"resolved","id":"715fc2a2ad4968cc","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{BestFit}_n,\\mathrm{Err}_n$ 使用 [[27-df-bestfit]]、[[27-df-fiterror]] 的精确接口，$\\mathrm{Ext}_n$ 使用 [[27-df-extension]] 的固定元数接口。","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-fiterror","status":"resolved","id":"00d5aa0e1574d0b4","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{BestFit}_n,\\mathrm{Err}_n$ 使用 [[27-df-bestfit]]、[[27-df-fiterror]] 的精确接口，$\\mathrm{Ext}_n$ 使用 [[27-df-extension]] 的固定元数接口。","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-extension","status":"resolved","id":"2080bf803b294b75","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{BestFit}_n,\\mathrm{Err}_n$ 使用 [[27-df-bestfit]]、[[27-df-fiterror]] 的精确接口，$\\mathrm{Ext}_n$ 使用 [[27-df-extension]] 的固定元数接口。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"T,F\\subseteq\\mathbb B^n","display":false},{"tex":"w:T\\cup F\\to\\mathbb R_{>0}","display":false},{"tex":"\\emptyset\\ne\\mathcal K\\subseteq\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{BestFit}_n,\\mathrm{Err}_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Ext}_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\min_{f\\in\\mathcal K}\\mathrm{Err}_n(f;T,F,w)=0\\quad\\Longleftrightarrow\\quad\\mathcal K\\cap\\mathrm{Ext}_n(T,F)\\ne\\emptyset.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathcal K\\cap\\mathrm{Ext}_n(T,F)\\ne\\emptyset\\quad\\Longrightarrow\\quad\\mathrm{BestFit}_n(T,F,w;\\mathcal K)=\\mathcal K\\cap\\mathrm{Ext}_n(T,F).","display":true}],"bytes":1980,"backlinks":[{"id":"5244dbb38da17b8a","anchor":"ref-374","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[27-thm-bestfitexact|thm-bestfitexact — Zero best fit is exact extension under positive weights]]"}],"outgoing":["715fc2a2ad4968cc","2080bf803b294b75","00d5aa0e1574d0b4"]}